@task drop-door-fallback
  meaning
    says "Once @inventarch/mcp-door ships ia_session, ia_catalogue and ia_method, move .mcp.json and the pins to it and drop the lanes' scripts/resolve.mjs fallback. Done in 1.2.0: the 3.5.0 door lists all three tools over stdio (checked 2026-11-01), the door pin is 3.5.0 and the lanes name only the door. scripts/resolve.mjs stays for ia:init, ia:delegate and the kits' own cases; making it a thin caller of the shared runtime's packet builder is not part of this task."
