@task cli-3-6-0-resolver-parity
  meaning
    says "scripts/resolve.mjs and scripts/check.mjs refuse IA-CORE-KIT-NOT-INSTALLED, with the door's message and error.kit, before retaining or writing anything (public-cli-3-6-0-resolver A). This is carried out by the resolver and check changes already on the release N branch, and verified with the install migration."
