@task cli-3-6-0-bind-mjs-guard
  meaning
    says "scripts/bind.mjs set and recommend can still write keys for a kit the lock does not install, which kit.mjs bind now refuses (public-cli-3-6-0-bind). The resolver guard catches it at resolve time. Decide whether bind.mjs should refuse them too, or leave the guard as the one place."
  work
    title "Guard bind.mjs against an uninstalled kit"
    status proposed
