    says "Stamp the 3.6.0 re-cut as patches (public-cli-3-6-0-kit-level). Set each kit's .ia/release.json source.commit to the merged sources commit. Run IA_CLI_PATH=<3.6.0 dist/main.js> node tools/kit.mjs pack <kit> for each kit, then node tools/kit.mjs bundle --write, index --write and package --write. Raise packages/public-kits/package.json, and merge with a merge commit."
